OL,3,AMan died of cardiac arrest on flight,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British man who died on board a
OL,7,FSingapore Airlines flight suffered a
OL,8,Fcardiac arrest after the plane was hit
OL,9,Fby severe turbulence, an inquest has
OL,10,Fbeen told.
OL,12,FGeoff Kitchen, from Thornbury in South
OL,13,FGloucestershire, died on 21 May 2024
OL,14,Fafter the Boeing 777 plane travelling
OL,15,Ffrom London Heathrow to Singapore
OL,16,Fencountered a sudden drop in altitude
OL,17,Fnear the south western region of
OL,18,FMyanmar.
OL,20,FThe plane was later diverted to
OL,21,FBangkok, Thailand, where the
OL,22,F73-year-old was pronounced dead.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
