OL,3,AMan died of cardiac arrest on flight,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Peter Harrowing, assistant coroner
OL,7,Ffor Avon, said: "I am satisfied that it
OL,8,Fwas the physiological effect of the
OL,9,Faircraft turbulence which precipitated
OL,10,Fthe cardiac arrest and ultimately
OL,11,FGeoff's demise."
